  "root_idea": {
    "summary": "The lexical field is centered on the cardinal number six and its numerical extensions.",
    "development": "The numeral is explained as historically related to سُدْس or سِدْس, with the original د changed and incorporated into ت; the same numerical base gives sixty and related ordinal and compound forms.",
